WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
You have never been grateful once

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:03,400
And in turn, they suppressed him and blindly asked for marriage.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,900
Said he was insincere

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,400
Those of you who have always accepted his help

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,400
What's the point of sincerity?

6
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:09,500
What this little brother said

7
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,500
I'm worried

8
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:12,500
I should first express my gratitude to Captain Han.

9
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,500
Take them all out

10
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,000
This is a box of 100,000 gold coins

11
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Thank you for helping us in the early stage

12
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,500
Rongyin was forced to panic.

13
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,500
Only scumbags

14
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,000
Only then can we deal with the scumbag Captain Han

15
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Can you send more support tomorrow?

16
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Help us get out this time

17
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:25,000
I definitely mean it

18
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,980
That being the case

19
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:32,980
I'll send a message now

20
00:00:41,020 --> 00:00:44,060
My gold box, he's still alive tomorrow

21
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,150
Get rid of him
